 ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ´ USER GUIDE ÃÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ
                               ÀÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÙ

   OBJECTIVE OF THE GAME
   ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ

   Very simple: to make your monkey fill the screen with bananas.

   HOW TO PLAY IT
   ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ

   Click on a number in any  of  the  8 squares (including diagonals) next to
   the monkey square.

   He will eat the number  of  bananas  the  square  indicates  in  the  same
   direction from the monkey picture.

   You continue do this until the game is over.

   If  you  jump  onto a tree position (a small circle) you will be given the
   opportunity to jump to another tree.

   You will find that the trees will  help  you when you do not know where to
   go!

   BEWARE!
   ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ

   You end the current game if you:

   * Fall off the edge of the screen;
   * Run into any Black Spider;
   * Run into any banana that is already peeled;
   * Are blocked and cannot move.

   CONTROLS
   ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ

   Use use arrow keys  to  move  your  selection  to  a position next to your
   monkey.

   Press space to move that direction.

   When you land on a tree, you must jump to another tree. You can  move  the
   blinking  selection  with  the  arrow keys. Press space (or enter) and you
   will istantly jump to that tree.

   You can always press the Menu (and menu shortcuts) or the Help keys.

   These are the Menu options:

   New Game            Starts a new game!
   No Trees/Use Trees  Toggles trees in game
                       (To enable these options you need to start a new game)
   Sound volume        Let you choose (and disable) the sound in the game
   Exit                Exits from Gold Monkey

   Top Bananas         The High-Score of the game
   About               Try to guess!
   Help                This help screen
   Register            Lets you enter the registration code

   PLEASE NOTE:
   ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ
   As unregistered versions do not store the user options, Gold Monkey always
   has  the  sound  enabled  while starting. To disable the nag-screen beeps,
   turn off the beeps from the system screen of your Series-3a.


